@startuml
!theme plain
title Portfolio - planned frontend context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Portfolio visitor" as Visitor
actor "Portfolio owner" as Owner
rectangle "Frontend design scope" {
  component "Portfolio frontend\nScreens, navigation, forms,\nslideshow and file interactions" as Frontend
}
rectangle "External dependencies" #F0F0F0 {
  component "Backend API" as Backend
  database "Portfolio database" as Database
  component "Durable file storage" as Files
}

Visitor --> Frontend : explore projects, profile and permitted files
Owner --> Frontend : manage portfolio and account actions
Frontend --> Backend : planned API requests and responses
Backend --> Database : planned record persistence
Backend --> Files : planned media, releases and CV storage

note bottom of Frontend
  This diagram specifies the target frontend.
  No direct database connection or browser persistence fallback.
end note
note bottom of Backend
  External context only, not a backend design.
  Authentication, authorization and persistence
  will be implemented separately.
end note
@enduml
